\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 Nurse practitioners are experienced registered nurses who have completed a master\u8217 s degree. They and endorsed midwives are now prevented from autonomously providing Medicare services and prescribing Pharmaceutical Benefits Scheme medicines without the supervision of a doctor.}
